                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Started the game off smooth, then we got to the piano. We had it set to random selection, and this time I was blind. Deaf dumbass starts telling me the numbers… in Spanish. I don’t speak Spanish.\n\nHe kept saying “cinco,” so I guessed 7. Wrong. Then I guessed 6. Also wrong. Then we exploded.\n\nWe yelled at him after to say in english. Then we tried again.\n\nWe got the exact same roles, and this time he starts saying “tres.” I have zero clue what that is either, so I guessed 7.\n\nWe proceded to explode again.\n\nHis first language is English btw. 10/10 game.",
